    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The borderlands of the Ferzenstein Marquisate... Here, the damage caused by dark monsters was rapidly increasing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Royal Church, concerned about the situation, ordered two exorcists to investigate the cause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of them, Marianne, armed with her trusty chain whip, sets foot in that land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Game Description</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a full-fledged side-scrolling action game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the protagonist Marianne and defeat the enemies that attack you as you face the disaster that is ravaging the Felsenstein territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbQuest Selection</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various people living in the Felsenstein territory will come to Marianne and her companions with requests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can choose any request and advance the story by clearing it.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some cleared quests may affect the later story... ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Skills and Items  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game does not have the concept of levels.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead, quests allow you to bring four skills and items within a certain cost limit.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a quest is difficult to clear, adjusting your skills and items to match the enemies may make the battle easier.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The borderlands of the Ferzenstein Marquisate... Here, the damage caused by dark monsters was rapidly increasing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Royal Church, concerned about the situation, ordered two exorcists to investigate the cause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of them, Marianne, armed with her trusty chain whip, sets foot in that land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0Game Description</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a full-fledged side-scrolling action game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the protagonist Marianne and defeat the enemies that attack you as you face the disaster that is ravaging the Felsenstein territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbQuest Selection</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various people living in the Felsenstein territory will come to Marianne and her companions with requests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can choose any request and advance the story by clearing it.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some cleared quests may affect the later story... ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Skills and Items  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game does not have the concept of levels.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead, quests allow you to bring four skills and items within a certain cost limit.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a quest is difficult to clear, adjusting your skills and items to match the enemies may make the battle easier.</p>",
